[{"id":"CN-TR-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","连接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 的“连接”应如何理解？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它是双方维护的有状态字节流传输上下文，通常由两端 IP 和端口组成的四元组标识。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>连接不是一根物理线路，也不是 HTTP 请求本身。它包含序列空间、确认、窗口、状态和计时器；同一 TCP 连接可以承载多个 HTTP 请求。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>TCP 连接可以用一个有状态的四元组理解：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">客户端 IP:端口  ↔  服务端 IP:端口\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">       伴随序列空间、窗口、状态和计时器\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>它不是物理线路，也不是单个 HTTP 请求；同一连接可以承载多个请求。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-risk-vs-coverage","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["策略","风险"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(二)测试策略与质量模型.md","articleTitle":"App测试(二)测试策略与质量模型","articlePath":"posts/688d03c1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(二)测试策略与质量模型.md","articleTitle":"App测试(二)测试策略与质量模型","articlePath":"posts/688d03c1/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不能用“测试用例数量”直接代表 App 测试覆盖率？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>数量没有说明风险、状态和设备组合是否被覆盖。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖率要回答“哪些风险在什么条件下被验证”，而不是“写了多少条用例”。同一条顺利路径可以在多个设备上重复，却仍遗漏拒绝、断网和进程死亡。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>维度\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>需要回答的问题\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>风险\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>哪些用户损失最严重？\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>状态\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>哪些状态转移和恢复路径被验证？\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>环境\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>哪些系统、形态和硬件差异会改变结果？\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>证据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>失败能否由另一位成员复现？\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此，发布判断应同时看风险矩阵、状态覆盖、设备矩阵和证据完整性；数量只能作为工作量指标。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-storage-state","type":"choice","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["BrowserContext","登录状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>业务回归套件需要复用登录时，哪种方式更合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>storage_state 可以复用已验证会话，同时保持每个测试独立创建 Context；状态文件必须按凭据管理并验证有效期。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>复用登录态的安全边界是“文件可复用，Context 不共享”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">context = browser.new_context(storage_state=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;buyer.json&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">page = context.new_page()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>每条用例仍创建自己的 Context；storage_state 只保存经审查的会话材料，不能把真实账号 Cookie 提交到仓库。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>所有测试共享同一个 Page\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>为角色生成受控 storage_state，并创建独立 Context\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>把真实账号 Cookie 提交到仓库\u003c/p>\n"}]}]